# Archosaurian Empire

id:polity-archosaurian-empire a oa:Polity ;
    skos:prefLabel "Archosaurian Empire" ;
    oa:ambiguousName false ;
    oa:color "#728C23" ;
    oa:editorialNote "M39 is Cygexpa's on the political maps and the Archosaurians' by article,\nwhich is not a contradiction: Cygexpa dissolved and this is who is there\nnow. Both are recorded, so the cluster ring is drawn halved.\n17.3 from its nearest, which is the Amalgamation." ;
    oa:hasSource src:eg-system-articles ;
    oa:kind "polity" ;
    oa:polityId "archosaurian-empire" ;
    oa:recordOrder 44 ;
    oa:uncertain false .
